/V (In my role as the managing director of Purdue's Center for Entrepreneurship, I utilized various skills, including building relationships, coaching early-stage startup companies, and analyzing business models. My startup experience in Silicon Valley provides me with a "west coast perspective," complemented by my familiarity with living in the Midwest.)
/F 4
/T (What talents or experience would you bring to the board/commission)
/Rect [72.157200 184.443000 490.754000 225.952000]
/P 546 0 R
