/FT /Tx
/DA (/BentonSans-Light 12 Tf 0 g)
/Subtype /Widget
/Type /Annot
/V (Like many in the community, I grew up in West Lafayette in 70's and 80's.  I ended up in California for my first job and spent almost 20 years out west.  In 2015 my wife and two kids decided to relocate back to West Lafayette to raise our family.   I have always considered West Lafayette home.  I would like to give back to the community by serving on the RDC.)
/F 4
/T (Why are you interested in serving this board/commission)
/Rect [72.448100 245.679000 491.045000 287.189000]
/P 546 0 R
